<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF SARDINIA FIRST STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>CAGLIARI, Sardinia 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>182-km first stage of the Tour of Sardinia cycle race on</p>
<p>Wednesday (Italians unless stated):</p>
<p> 1. Nicola Minali	  4 hours 18 minutes 36 seconds</p>
<p>2. Endrio Leoni</p>
<p>3. Maurizio Tomi</p>
<p>4. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>5. Massimiliano Mori</p>
<p>6. Gabriele Balducci</p>
<p>7. Vyacheslav Djavanian (Russia)</p>
<p>8. Federico Colonna</p>
<p>9. Fulvio Frigo</p>
<p> 10.Sandro Giacomelli    all same time as Minali</p>
